### 1. GET - Ambil seluruh data pasien
GET http://localhost:3000/patients

### 2. GET - Ambil satu data pasien berdasarkan ID
GET http://localhost:3000/patients/PS-1042

### 3. POST - Tambah pasien baru (sukses)
POST http://localhost:3000/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Ahmad Fauzi",
  "nik": "3302101205980009",
  "email": "ahmad.fauzi@example.com",
  "telepon": "081234567899",
  "alamat": "Jln. Overste Isdiman No. 18, Purwokerto",
  "jenisKelamin": "Laki-laki",
  "tanggalLahir": "1998-05-12",
  "poli": "Pemeriksaan Umum",
  "keluhan": "Sakit kepala dan demam ringan sejak kemarin"
}

### 4. PATCH - Ubah status pasien
PATCH http://localhost:3000/patients/PS-1043
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Sedang Diperiksa"
}

### 5. DELETE - Hapus data pasien
DELETE http://localhost:3000/patients/PS-1045

### 6. Uji Validasi DTO (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "AB",
  "nik": "123",
  "telepon": "0812",
  "alamat": "",
  "jenisKelamin": "Tidak Diketahui",
  "tanggalLahir": "bukan-tanggal",
  "poli": "Poli Tidak Ada"
}

### 7. Uji Exception Handling - NotFoundException (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:3000/patients/PS-9999

### 8. Uji Exception Handling - ConflictException (409 Conflict - NIK Duplikat)
POST http://localhost:3000/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Budi Duplikat",
  "nik": "3302101508920001",
  "telepon": "081234567890",
  "alamat": "Jln. Jend. Soedirman No. 12, Purwokerto",
  "jenisKelamin": "Laki-laki",
  "tanggalLahir": "1992-08-15",
  "poli": "Pemeriksaan Umum"
}
